WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.375
Watch and read: For your letterwriting practice, you are practising the letter A.

00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:05.981
What is the best answer?

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:11.888
The answer is: Write capital A and small a neatly. Read the instruction carefully and

00:00:11.888 --> 00:00:13.930
choose the helpful or correct response.

00:00:14.783 --> 00:00:19.809
Watch and read: For your case practice, which spelling correctly writes the name of a

00:00:19.809 --> 00:00:20.479
person: ama?

00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:25.422
The answer is: Ama. Names of people begin with capital letters.
